content.thinking:
D5 red ✓ (endpoint detection misses the clean pass). Now the D5 fix: replace the endpoint `collides()` detection with swept slab contact for the brick collision. This is the big one — the swept machinery. Per my design:

1. Record the pre-move position (px, py) at the start of step().
2. Move the ball + wall/ceiling clamps (as today).
